  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In translocation desert, earth qi moves like bubbles in water and opens tiny caves. Where the earth qi is dense enough that an earth qi sandstorm is brewing, the cave holds a dark and heavy lump of moving sand with immortal material aura. That sandstorm is made from earth qi and is a rank seven immortal material. Fiend Mosquito names the lump earth qi essence when he wonders why Three Feather Boy left it behind. Ordinary earth qi as a collectible resource is covered on earth qi.",
